   "n": 43,
   "html": "O aquário tem a forma de um bloco retangular. Lembre: <b>volume = comprimento × largura × altura</b> e <b>1 L = 1.000 cm³</b>.<div class=\"row\"><svg class=\"ill\" width=\"266\" height=\"152\" viewBox=\"0 0 266 152\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g transform=\"translate(30,0)\"><path d=\"M30 40 l40 -26 h130 v88 l-40 26\" fill=\"#eaf6ff\" stroke=\"#2b2b3a\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M70 14 v88 h130 M70 102 l-40 26\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2b2b3a\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><path d=\"M30 62 l40 -26 h130 l-40 26 Z\" fill=\"#bfe3fb\" stroke=\"#4c9be8\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"30\" y=\"62\" width=\"130\" height=\"66\" fill=\"#9fd3fa\" fill-opacity=\".75\"/><path d=\"M160 62 l40 -26 v66 l-40 26 Z\" fill=\"#7fc1f2\" fill-opacity=\".75\"/><rect x=\"30\" y=\"40\" width=\"130\" height=\"88\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2b2b3a\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><path d=\"M160 40 l40 -26 v88 l-40 26\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2b2b3a\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M30 40 l40 -26 h130\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2b2b3a\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M84 96 q14 -12 28 0 q-14 12 -28 0 Z M84 96 l-10 -8 v16 Z\" fill=\"#f4a261\" stroke=\"#2b2b3a\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><circle cx=\"104\" cy=\"94\" r=\"1.6\" fill=\"#2b2b3a\"/><path d=\"M120 122 q-4 -14 2 -24 M128 124 q4 -10 -1 -18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2E9E6B\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><text x=\"95.0\" y=\"146.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Fredoka\" font-weight=\"600\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#2b2b3a\">50 cm</text><text x=\"24.0\" y=\"88.0\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"Fredoka\" font-weight=\"600\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#2b2b3a\">40 cm</text><text x=\"186.0\" y=\"130.0\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Fredoka\" font-weight=\"600\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#2b2b3a\">30 cm</text></g></svg><div class=\"ql\"><div>a) Volume do aquário: <input class=\"in\" data-a=\"60000\" da